{"strongs": "H1131", "word": "בִּנּוּי", "translit": "bin.nuy", "root": "בלס", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine 1.", "gloss": "head of a family that returned with Zerubbabel", "definition": "בִּנּוּי proper name, masculine 1. head of a family that returned with Zerubbabel Neh 7:15 (= בָּנִי || Ezra 2:10 & perhaps Ezra 10:34 compare Sm Listen 14 ; but BeRy proposes here בִּגְוַי ). 2. a Levite of Ezra's time Ezra 8:33 ; Neh 10:10 (properly = בָּנִי Neh 8:7 , בֻּנִּי Neh 9:4 ) Neh 12:8 compare Neh 3:24 ( בַּוַי , textual error v Neh 3:18 ) see BeRy ; also Ezra 2:40 = Neh 7:43 לִבְּנֵי read perhaps לְבִנֻּי compare Sm Listen 16 but BeRy otherwise; compare further Gr Geschichte.ii.2, 389. 3. Israelites of Ezra's time, \\ \\ a. Ezra 10:30 \\ \\ b. Ezra 10:38 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1185')\">BDB1185</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1131')\">H1131</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1184')\">BDB1184</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1186')\">BDB1186</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בִּנּוּי</bdbheb><div class=\"point\"><b>proper name, masculine 1.</b> <highlightword>head of a family that returned with Zerubbabel</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Neh 7:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,15)\">Neh 7:15</ref> (= <bdbheb>בָּנִי</bdbheb> || <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,10)\">Ezra 2:10</ref> &amp; perhaps <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:34\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,34)\">Ezra 10:34</ref> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sm')\">Sm<sup>Listen 14</sup></lookup>; but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">BeRy</lookup> proposes here <bdbheb>בִּגְוַי</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a Levite of Ezra's time <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,33)\">Ezra 8:33</ref>; <re